a-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa))\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa))\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa))\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Extendible}(\\kappa))\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa))\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa))\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Supercompact}_S(\\kappa))\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\land\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Strong}_S(\\kappa))\\to\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\mathrm{ZFC}+\\exists\\kappa\\,\\mathrm{Measurable}(\\kappa))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Huge 与 extendible 在此保留为分别通向 supercompact 的两条分支；原文件未经论证地把它们排成单一线性链，并且缺少括号导致蕴含与合取的作用域不清。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 的有限证明系统已由依赖给出；但是本文件中的类嵌入大基数陈述尚未转成该证明系统的一阶闭句码，因此此文件仅完成一致性算子依赖修订，不能据此认定全部类型已闭合。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-huge.md","status":"resolved","id":"641a3566187bf66b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-huge.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-extendible","status":"resolved","id":"955facc376d59b85","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-extendible]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-supercompact.md","status":"resolved","id":"6a78f267f6eefd08","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-superc